s). Steps are a single repeated module (one step mesh x 10).&amp;#10;&amp;#10;DIMENSIONS: 10 steps: 1.25 W x 0.30 D x 0.15 R (rise 1.5 m total), parapet 0.5 m high&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MATERIALS: Stone (steps, parapet), green iron (railing variant), optional greenery (vine on parapet — low-poly leaves).&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHAT TO MODEL FROM THE REFERENCES: see red circles on the images." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;fontSize=13;spacing=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="470" width="700" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="BLOCKOUT SCREENSHOT
